	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "PUI Audio DMM-4026-B-I2S-R bottom-port MEMS I2S microphone. Body 4.00 x 3.00 x 1.00 mm. Land pattern reproduced from the PUI Audio DMM-4026-B-I2S-R data sheet (Rev A, 5/26/2021) Dimensions page and Suggested Pickup Tool Location and Land Pattern page: six 0.60 x 0.40 mm pads on two columns 2.15 mm apart with a 0.65 mm row pitch, plus pad 4 as the GND ring around the acoustic port, ID 1.05 mm / OD 1.65 mm, on the package width centreline 1.00 mm from the near short edge. Pin 1 is at the upper LEFT in this TOP view because the manufacturer drawing is a bottom view. THE PCB ACOUSTIC HOLE IS NOT PART OF THIS FOOTPRINT: drill a 1.05 mm non-plated hole concentric with pad 4 at PCB stage, and keep solder paste back from the hole edge so solder cannot wick into the acoustic port. Both are FBV2-S2 / PCB-stage items.")
	(tags "microphone MEMS I2S PUI Audio DMM-4026 bottom port")
